========================================
CONFIGURATION FILE - Application Settings
========================================
Purpose: Sample configuration file demonstrating
         comments in nested folders
Location: src/data/configs/
Author: Coding Agent
Date: 2025-11-14
========================================

# Application Configuration
# This section contains application-wide settings

app.name=CodingAgentTest
app.version=1.0.0
app.debug=false

# Database Configuration
# Connection settings for the application database

db.host=localhost
db.port=5432
db.name=testdb
db.user=admin

# Logging Configuration
# Settings for application logging

log.level=INFO
log.file=/var/log/app.log
log.rotation=daily

========================================
Note: This file demonstrates that comments
work at any directory depth in the folder structure
========================================
END OF CONFIGURATION FILE
========================================
